# Raw source data is kept locally; it is too large for the repository.
docs/資料集/

# app/public/data/roi/station-details-*.bin (the per-station raw drill-down,
# regenerated by `npm run data:profile`) IS committed: a small, fixed number
# of binary shards (each under Cloudflare Pages' 25MiB per-file cap), fetched
# per-station via HTTP Range requests. The ROI page degrades gracefully if
# they are ever absent (stale local checkout, etc).

# Dev-only mirror of the replay/live-profile build output (normally only
# written to app/dist/ by stage-pages-static.mjs). Regenerated by predev via
# scripts/export-dev-static.mjs so `npm run dev` has station popularity and
# replay data without a full build.
app/public/data/replay/
app/public/data/live-profile/

# ML PoC: derived data, model artifacts and the local virtual environment.
ml/data/
ml/output/
ml/.venv/
__pycache__/

# pytorch-lightning's default Trainer writes these to the CWD (repo root,
# since ml/src scripts are run via `python ml/src/train_tft.py` from there).
checkpoints/
lightning_logs/

# Full XGBoost models exported for the local `npm run predict:xgboost` demo
# (ml/src/export_model_for_web.py) -- 80-134MB each once category lists are
# included, far past Cloudflare Pages' 25MiB per-asset cap and not meant to
# be deployed. Only their small live-predictions.json output is committed.
# See docs/PoC交接.md's "即時 XGBoost 缺車/滿車警報" section.
app/public/data/xgboost/model-*.json

# Ad hoc analysis reports for local review; not build output, not final artifacts.
# docs/_scratch/

# Stitch 匯出的設計稿圖檔(約 19MB),只留本機:設計方向已在 grilling 定案，
# 對它們的盤點分析 docs/_scratch/stitch/INVENTORY.md 有進版控，圖檔本身沒有。
docs/_scratch/**/*.png
